---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import {clinic, whatsappBookingUrl} from '../../data/clinic';
const bookingUrl = whatsappBookingUrl('/doctors/dr-bhakti-ghanwat-gavade/');
import {doctor} from '../../data/evidence';
---
<Layout title="Dr. Bhakti Ghanwat Gavade, BDS | Dentist at 32 Whites, Pune" description="Meet Dr. Bhakti Ghanwat Gavade, BDS, Government Dental College & Hospital Mumbai. Maharashtra dental registration A-33908. Visit 32 Whites, Keshavnagar." pageType="ProfilePage" mainEntity={`${clinic.url}/#doctor`} breadcrumbs={[{name:'Our clinic',path:'/about/'},{name:'Dr. Bhakti',path:doctor.profile}]}>
  <div class="container"><section class="page-hero page-hero-wide"><span class="eyebrow">Your dentist · Keshavnagar, Pune</span><h1>{doctor.name}</h1><p>Bachelor of Dental Surgery (BDS)<br/>{doctor.college}</p><div class="actions"><a class="button button-dark" href={bookingUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track="whatsapp_booking_click"><Icon name="chat" size={18}/>Book on WhatsApp</a><a class="button button-outline" href={`tel:${clinic.phone}`} data-track="call_click"><Icon name="phone" size={18}/>Call {clinic.phoneDisplay}</a></div></section><div class="content-grid"><article class="article-content"><section><h2>Qualifications & registration</h2><dl class="credential-list"><div><dt>Qualification</dt><dd>Bachelor of Dental Surgery · BDS</dd></div><div><dt>Dental college</dt><dd>{doctor.college}</dd></div><div><dt>Professional registration</dt><dd>{doctor.council} · <strong>{doctor.registration}</strong></dd></div><div><dt>Clinic</dt><dd>{clinic.name}<br/>{clinic.address}</dd></div></dl></section><section><h2>Your concerns deserve a place in the consultation</h2><p>Perhaps one tooth hurts, a missing tooth bothers you or you feel nervous about coming in. Bring that concern, your previous records and your medicine list. Your examination provides the starting point; these questions can help you weigh the next steps.</p><ul><li>What is causing the concern, and is further assessment needed?</li><li>What are the alternatives, including delaying treatment where appropriate?</li><li>Which risks, limitations and aftercare requirements apply to me?</li><li>What does the estimate include, and how many visits are expected?</li><li>Who will carry out each part of the treatment, and is referral needed?</li></ul></section><section><h2>English, Hindi or Marathi: use the language that feels natural</h2><p>The clinic can communicate in English, Hindi and Marathi. Mention your preferred language when arranging a visit.</p><a class="text-link" href="/blog/planning-your-first-dental-visit/">Prepare for your first visit<Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></a></section><section><h2>Get a feel for the care before you book</h2><nav class="filter-links" aria-label="Explore care"><a href="/services/">Treatment information</a><a href="/our-work/">Clinical updates</a><a href="/reviews/">Google review sources</a><a href="/pricing/">Cost planning</a></nav></section></article><aside class="content-aside" aria-labelledby="aside-heading"><h2 id="aside-heading">Visit 32 Whites</h2><p>{clinic.hours}<br/>{clinic.sunday}</p><p>Parking available. Access involves stairs; call before travelling if you need assistance.</p><div class="aside-links"><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Address, access & booking<Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></a><a class="text-link" href={clinic.maps} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track="directions_click">Open Google Maps<Icon name="diagonal" size={14}/></a></div></aside></div></div>
</Layout>
